# Git Commit Message Format
#
# <type>: <description>
#
# Types:
#   docs    - SDK documentation, manual, README changes
#   chore   - repository maintenance (e.g., .gitignore, CI config)
#
# Description:
#   - Use English
#   - Start with lowercase
#   - Single line, no body/footer
#
# Examples:
#   docs: update SDK_User_Manual.md version to 1.1.0
#   docs: add session:closing event documentation
#   chore: update .gitignore
